cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or analysis pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "COVID-19 vaccine effectiveness in two Colombian cities: a target trial emulation"
abstract: "Reproducible analysis pipeline for a population-based cohort study estimating the effectiveness of Colombia's National Vaccination Plan against SARS-CoV-2 infection, hospitalisation and death in Cali and Montería, February 2021 to June 2022. Includes a synthetic data generator with a known true effect, cohort construction with time-varying exposure on a calendar time scale, risk-set matching, effectiveness models and diagnostics."
